{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>The king's highway.</b> The road which the king commands us to travel — as is the custom of every king who designates a route for the army of his men of peace, sending with them a guide for the way, so that the soldiers, or any of them, cause no harm to the inhabitants of the land when they pass through."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:22.828671895Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}